@@ -65,6 +65,21 @@ ## User Administration
 | Remove user | Admin, owner | Cannot remove the owner; employees lose immediate access to the entity. |
 | Assign role | Admin, owner | Users are **separated by role**; employees receive granular permissions, not admin/owner role. |
 
+### Invites
+
+Membership is **invite-only**: a manager (owner or admin) invites an e-mail
+address with a role (`admin` or `employee`; never `owner`) and no membership
+exists until the invitee accepts. This prevents managers from discovering
+which e-mails already have accounts and prevents adding users without consent.
+
+- An invite is tied to one entity and e-mail (unique per entity), expires after
+  **7 days**, and is pending until accepted or expired.
+- The invitee accepts from the entity switcher or onboarding, which creates the
+  membership with the invited role and opens the entity dashboard.
+- Managers may cancel pending invites; expired invites may be replaced.
+- Invitations are rate limited to 10 successful sends per manager per entity
+  per hour.
+
 ## Queue and Tickets
 
 ### Ticket
